  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, an etherslinger gains one of the following firearms of her choice: blunderbuss, musket, or pistol. Her starting weapon is battered, and only she knows how to use it properly. All other creatures treat her gun as if it had the broken condition. If the weapon already has the broken condition, it does not work at all for anyone else trying to use it. This starting weapon can only be sold for scrap (it’s worth 4d10 gp when sold). The etherslinger also gains Gunsmithing as a bonus feat, but does not gain the Restoring a Broken Firearm ability of the feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/etherslinger#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
